sequenceDiagram
    participant Docker as Docker Compose
    participant MySQL
    participant Keycloak
    participant Selenium as Selenium Hub
    participant Service as Trails Service

    Docker->>MySQL: Start database container
    MySQL-->>Docker: Health check succeeds
    Docker->>Keycloak: Start identity provider
    Docker->>Selenium: Start Selenium Hub and browser nodes
    Docker->>Service: Start backend container
    Service->>MySQL: Open datasource and run migrations
    Service->>Selenium: Use configured Grid URL when executions start
    Service->>Keycloak: Use issuer/JWK configuration when OAuth2 is enabled
